{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>A hundredfold.</b> In the words of our Sages of blessed memory it is a measure: he found a hundred times the measure of the seed, and it is from the same root as \"like a measure in his soul\" (Proverbs 23:7)."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra's source for this reading appears to be Genesis Rabbah 64:6; the verse citation from Proverbs 23:7 is given to show the word שער in the sense of measure/estimate."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:45:54.634986707Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}